{"unit_id": "BJ1919810__dsh-rea#card-zh", "repo": "BJ1919810/dsh-rea", "commit": "c0b4f1b8491d9315e81543ecd335c34ee866ef8c", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-rea 是一个 DSH 插件，将 REA MCP 服务和三项工作流技能纳入同一个 bundle 开关。启用时，bundle 注册 rea-skills 技能 provider，并配置 rea-mcp 通过 stdio 启动 rea-agents；技能 provider 提供逆向分析、工具设计和变更日志工作流指导。适合需要在 DSH 中使用 REA 分析工具并加载其操作指南的用户。使用对应引擎前需自行安装和配置 REA 所需环境变量。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:31-32", "lib/index.js:95-107", "cordis.patch.yml:27-36"]}
{"unit_id": "BJ1919810__dsh-rea#card-en", "repo": "BJ1919810/dsh-rea", "commit": "c0b4f1b8491d9315e81543ecd335c34ee866ef8c", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "dsh-rea enables the REA MCP service and three workflow skills through one DSH bundle switch. It registers a skill provider and launches rea-agents over stdio. The skills guide reverse engineering, tool design, and changelog updates. Users configure the analysis engines they need.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:31-32", "lib/index.js:95-107", "cordis.patch.yml:27-36"]}
{"unit_id": "BJ1919810__dsh-rea#feature-1", "repo": "BJ1919810/dsh-rea", "commit": "c0b4f1b8491d9315e81543ecd335c34ee866ef8c", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-rea 的功能「REA 技能目录」：注册技能 provider 并列出三个随包提供的工作流技能。启用插件后，DSH 可按名称取得候选技能。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:31-32", "lib/index.js:70-97"]}
{"unit_id": "BJ1919810__dsh-rea#feature-2", "repo": "BJ1919810/dsh-rea", "commit": "c0b4f1b8491d9315e81543ecd335c34ee866ef8c", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-rea 的功能「技能正文读取」：根据技能候选读取对应 SKILL.md，移除 YAML frontmatter 后返回描述与正文内容。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:57-64", "lib/index.js:95-102"]}
